1
00:00:00,404 --> 00:00:03,494
(Bernadette:)Come on, Howard,
I'm not falling for that again.

2
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:07,910
(Howard:)No, here.

3
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:14,210
(Bernadette:)Oh, Howie, a little star.

4
00:00:14,418 --> 00:00:15,588
(Bernadette:)It's beautiful.

5
00:00:15,794 --> 00:00:16,964
(Bernadette:)Put it on me.

6
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:19,590
Okay, but I'm gonna have
to get it back from you...

7
00:00:19,798 --> 00:00:23,008
(Howard:)...so I can take it
to the lnternational Space Station.

8
00:00:23,218 --> 00:00:25,508
(Howard:)That way, when I come home...

9
00:00:25,721 --> 00:00:29,431
(Howard:)...you will have a star
that was actually in space.

10
00:00:31,184 --> 00:00:32,434
(Bernadette:)Oh, my God.

11
00:00:32,644 --> 00:00:35,644
(Howard:)Take that, every guy
who's ever bought you anything.

12
00:00:37,858 --> 00:00:40,318
(Bernadette:)This is the most amazing gift
l've ever gotten.

13
00:00:48,327 --> 00:00:52,037
I'm going to the
supermarket to buy snacks for your trip!

14
00:00:52,247 --> 00:00:57,027
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Do you want me to get those
little boxes of Froot Loops you like?

